#: assets/Views/Admin/CommissionRates/RootView.php:145
msgid "Exclude Tax"
msgstr "Exclure la TVA"

#: assets/Views/Admin/CommissionRates/RootView.php:151
msgid ""
"Depending on your business, you may charge your customers tax, which is a "
"hard/net cost. This setting allows you to exclude tax from referral "
"calculations, so the order total that Solid Affiliate calculates the "
"referral amount from does not include the tax that is charged to customers."
msgstr ""
"Selon votre activité, vous pouvez facturer à vos clients la taxe, qui est un "
"coût fixe/net. Ce paramètre vous permet d'exclure la taxe des calculs de "
"commission, de sorte que le total de la commande à partir duquel Solid "
"Affiliate calcule le montant de la commission ne comprend pas la taxe "
"facturée aux clients."

#: assets/Views/Admin/CommissionRates/RootView.php:153
msgid "Enable this setting to exclude tax costs from referral calculations."
msgstr ""
"Activez ce paramètre pour exclure les coûts fiscaux des calculs de "
"commission."

